  "description": "Hanguk U’s resident piece of trash, Gam Do-woo. “Hyung, instead of that, to celebrate you coming back to school, you should seduce her and sleep with her once. It’s not like there’s a girl out there who wouldn’t fall for that face of yours anyway.” One day, Jian happened to overhear a crude drinking-table bet being made about her and Do-woo. “Guess I’ll give it a try, then.” At Do-woo’s answer, Jian bit down hard on her lip. But no matter how much strength she put into it, she couldn’t hold it back— the giddy little laugh of excitement spilling out of her. “…Hehehe.” Jian raised the fist she’d been clenching tight and pumped it wildly in the air. “This is so great. Looks like I might get to sleep with Gam Do-woo.” If he’s got women lining up for him like that, he’s not going to cling afterward. I can just have nice, clean sex without having to date him. Trash? Even better!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/6026000009), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=13513993), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/sb_02), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/please_just_once), [Toomics](https://toomics.com/click/intro?cno=9723&pid=conist&subpid1=adult) \n\n**Official Translations:**     \n[French](https://www.webtoons.com/fr/romance/just-eat-me-once-oppa/list?title_no=10053), [Thai](https://www.webtoons.com/th/romance/just-have-a-bite-oppa/list?title_no=10312)",
